  "foaf:name": "Yachts for Science (YSF)",
  "sdo:name": "Yachts for Science (YSF)",
  "sdo:description": "Yachts for Science (YFS) is a global, not-for-profit matchmaking platform dedicated to solving a critical bottleneck in marine conservation: the lack of access to vessels for scientists. Traditional vessel time is scarce and expensive (applications in the UK have a success rate of just 4% and far fewer in the majority of other ocean nations). Yacht for Science is the global, not-for-profit platform that bridges this gap by efficiently matching reputable marine scientists and research projects with ocean-conscious private vessel owners. We transform underutilized private assets (yachts) into agile, cost-effective platforms for scientific discovery and conservation.",
